  "id": "global-deterioration-scale",
  "term": "Global Deterioration Scale",
  "definition": "The Global Deterioration Scale is a dementia staging scale used to rate the overall progression of cognitive impairment. It is used across stages of dementia and considers cognition, daily functioning, and behavioral disturbance rather than relying only on a cognitive test score.",
